  <section name="Tomcat 6 Downloads">
    <p>Welcome to the Apache Tomcat&#8482; 6.x download page. This page provides
    download links for obtaining the latest version of Tomcat 6.0.x, as well as
    links to the archives of older releases.</p>
    <p>Users of Tomcat 6 should be aware that the Tomcat team have announced the
    <a href="tomcat-60-eol.html">end of life date for Tomcat 6.x</a>. Users of
    Tomcat 6.x should plan to upgrade before Tomcat 6.x reaches end of life.</p>
  </section>

